# Every world bundle under this directory is excluded from git by default - a bundle generated
# from a SillyTavern card (or anything else authored locally) may contain licensed content that
# must never be committed (see CLAUDE.md hard rule 2). To check a specific bundle in anyway,
# explicitly allow-list it with a pair of rules like the ones below (both are required: the first
# un-ignores the directory entry itself, the second un-ignores everything inside it).
*
!.gitignore
!blackwater_observatory/
!blackwater_observatory/**
